 I can explain. I...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_7","text":"How dare you hide your amazing cooking skills?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_8","text":"Tell you what: why don't we take turns making the meals from now on?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_9","text":"Thanks, but no thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_10","text":"Sounds like a pain in the butt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_11","text":"It'd be less irritating than having to sneak in here and cook in secret.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_12","text":"I only cook for myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_13","text":"I don't need to take care of the others.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_14","text":"Is that so? Then I guess there's nothing I can do about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_15","text":"However, you don't have to sneak around. Feel free to come and cook as you desire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_16","text":"Okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_17","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_npc_day12_08_17","text":"Emma and Eunhwa continue their conversation at the restaurant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}